      "widgets_values": [
        "DepthDots tips\n- Faces: model large, res 1036, detail 1.5, shade 0.3 (Enhance).\n- More/denser dots: raise dots; gamma >1 pushes dots to close areas; floor = background density.\n- color_mode: depth_shaded (tone = depth), flat (solid ink), source_color (needs source_image).\n- dark = white dots on black. size_by_depth = closer dots bigger.\n- Have a depth map already? LoadImage -> DepthDots Depth From Image -> Enhance/Render (see depth_map_in workflow).\n- The SaveImage filename_prefix comes from the Render node: <prefix>_<model>_r<res>_n<dots>_g.._s.._x..[_det.._sh..][_fixed][_dark][_color]..."
      ],
